hoices [{:answer/id #uuid "b210a9de-3fb8-5d18-b918-2389d8cea160" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x_2^2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530026}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b210a9de-3fb8-5d18-b918-2389d8cea160" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x_2^2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530026} :answer-field/id #uuid "7c6796e7-71f5-5e98-9a2e-b52f1df475d0" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186203332}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "42c18789-1e5f-52ac-ac15-9c282210e0f5" :question/math-academy-id "q-263490" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x;w)=({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2})^{2},$ compute ${∇}_{w}({∇}_{w}\\,f).$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"30px\">${∇}_{w}({∇}_{w}\\,f)=\\text{ }$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">$2{x}_{1}^{2}$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">$2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, we compute ${∇}_{w}\\,f$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{1}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{1}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2})^{2}=2({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2}){x}_{1} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{2}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2})^{2}=2({w}_{1}{x}_{1}+{w}_{2}{x}_{2}){x}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute the second derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}^{2}}=2{x}_{1}^{2}\\,\\, &  & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}∂{w}_{2}}=2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\  & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}∂{w}_{1}}=2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}\\,\\, &  & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}^{2}}=2{x}_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}({∇}_{w}\\,f) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}∂{w}_{2}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}∂{w}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}^{2}}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{1}^{2} & 2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} & 2{x}_{2}^{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530460 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c17d935-f775-5590-88e7-edcdebf8bd8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{1}^{2}{x}_{2}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529762}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4c17d935-f775-5590-88e7-edcdebf8bd8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{1}^{2}{x}_{2}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529762} :answer-field/id #uuid "55bfc75f-a93f-5dfe-96f2-3fb987481cc6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530282} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "739a1a33-00b9-5a65-8501-5416e50ad146" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529876}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "739a1a33-00b9-5a65-8501-5416e50ad146" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529876} :answer-field/id #uuid "ccec45eb-e36c-58f6-8fd2-058caac8f5c0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530368}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5ab6642a-36f8-590a-a631-0cf8a7d2875f" :question/math-academy-id "q-264894" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x;w)=({w}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{1}{x}_{2})^{2},$ compute ${∇}_{w}({∇}_{w}\\,f).$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"40px\">${∇}_{w}({∇}_{w}\\,f)=\\text{ }$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"50px\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"50px\">$-2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, we compute ${∇}_{w}\\,f$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{1}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{1}}({w}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{1}{x}_{2})^{2}=2({w}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{1}{x}_{2}) \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{2}}({w}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{1}{x}_{2})^{2}=-2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}({w}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{1}{x}_{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute the second derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}^{2}}=2\\,\\, &  & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}∂{w}_{2}}=-2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\  & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}∂{w}_{1}}=-2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}\\,\\, &  & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}^{2}}=2{x}_{1}^{2}{x}_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}({∇}_{w}\\,f) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{1}∂{w}_{2}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}∂{w}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{w}_{2}^{2}}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} & 2{x}_{1}^{2}{x}_{2}^{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530511 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "313b6c49-910b-52c6-8051-61e7626042a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2x_1x_2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529689}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "313b6c49-910b-52c6-8051-61e7626042a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2x_1x_2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529689} :answer-field/id #uuid "4cae36c3-55f0-5e58-bd81-7c16e62cd866" :answer